 "narration": {
  "lines": [
   {
    "i": 0,
    "text": "High above the clouds, among the towering peaks of an ancient mountain range, lives one of nature's most formidable predators.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.75,
    "start_s": 0.3,
    "end_s": 8.089
   },
   {"i": 1, "text": "The griffin.", "pause_after_s": 0.9, "start_s": 8.952, "end_s": 9.987},
   {
    "i": 2,
    "text": "With the powerful body of a lion and the wings and talons of an eagle, an adult griffin is capable of bringing down prey several times its own size.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 11.022,
    "end_s": 20.888
   },
   {"i": 3, "text": "But even the fiercest creatures must begin life somewhere.", "pause_after_s": 0.55, "start_s": 21.463, "end_s": 25.077},
   {
    "i": 4,
    "text": "Hidden within a nest perched high above the valley, a young griffin has recently emerged from its egg.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 25.71,
    "end_s": 31.643
   },
   {
    "i": 5,
    "text": "Covered in soft downy feathers, with oversized paws and wings far too small for flight, the chick bears little resemblance to the terrifying predator it will one day become.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 32.103,
    "end_s": 42.861
   },
   {"i": 6, "text": "For now, it is entirely dependent on its parents.", "pause_after_s": 0.45, "start_s": 43.321, "end_s": 46.356},
   {
    "i": 7,
    "text": "Each morning, the adults return from the hunt, carrying fresh meat to their hungry offspring.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 46.873,
    "end_s": 52.256
   },
   {
    "i": 8,
    "text": "The chick's hooked beak is already remarkably sharp, allowing it to tear small pieces of flesh, while its rapidly developing talons help it grip the rocky nest.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 52.716,
    "end_s": 62.681
   },
   {"i": 9, "text": "But growing up in the mountains is no easy task.", "pause_after_s": 0.4, "start_s": 63.256, "end_s": 66.331},
   {
    "i": 10,
    "text": "As the young griffin begins to explore, its curiosity frequently exceeds its coordination.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.35,
    "start_s": 66.791,
    "end_s": 72.584
   },
   {"i": 11, "text": "Its first attempts at flapping its wings are little more than clumsy leaps.", "pause_after_s": 0.4, "start_s": 72.986, "end_s": 77.573},
   {"i": 12, "text": "And a single misstep could send it plunging hundreds of metres into the valley below.", "pause_after_s": 0.5, "start_s": 78.033, "end_s": 83.243},
   {"i": 13, "text": "Fortunately, its mother is never far away.", "pause_after_s": 0.55, "start_s": 83.818, "end_s": 86.806},
   {
    "i": 14,
    "text": "For nearly a year, the young griffin remains under the protection of its parents, gradually developing the muscular chest and enormous flight feathers required to take to the skies.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 87.438,
    "end_s": 98.09
   },
   {
    "i": 15,
    "text": "Its eyesight becomes extraordinarily acute, allowing it to detect movement across vast distances.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 98.55,
    "end_s": 104.929
   },
   {
    "i": 16,
    "text": "Meanwhile, its once-soft paws develop into powerful weapons, equipped with curved claws capable of gripping struggling prey.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.55,
    "start_s": 105.389,
    "end_s": 113.066
   },
   {"i": 17, "text": "Eventually, the time comes for its first flight.", "pause_after_s": 0.45, "start_s": 113.698, "end_s": 116.491},
   {"i": 18, "text": "With an uncertain leap from the cliff's edge, the young griffin spreads its wings.", "pause_after_s": 0.4, "start_s": 117.009, "end_s": 121.641},
   {"i": 19, "text": "For a moment, it falls.", "pause_after_s": 0.95, "start_s": 122.101, "end_s": 123.977},
   {"i": 20, "text": "But then, catching the rising mountain winds, it begins to soar.", "pause_after_s": 0.55, "start_s": 125.07, "end_s": 129.053},
   {
    "i": 21,
    "text": "The helpless chick has taken its first step toward becoming one of the sky's most feared hunters.",
    "pause_after_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 129.685,
    "end_s": 135.549
   },
   {"i": 22, "text": "And one day, it too will return to these mountains.", "pause_after_s": 0.7, "start_s": 136.124, "end_s": 139.282},
   {"i": 23, "text": "Not as a fledgling.", "pause_after_s": 0.6, "start_s": 140.087, "end_s": 141.767},
   {"i": 24, "text": "But as a guardian of the next generation.", "pause_after_s": 0.0, "start_s": 142.457, "end_s": 145.343}
  ],
