  "title": "Meet the Griffins: A Baby Griffin's First Flight",
  "description": "High above the clouds, a griffin chick hatches on a narrow cliff ledge. It's all fluff, oversized paws and wings far too small to fly with, yet within a year it will take its first leap from the cliff and start becoming one of the most feared hunters in the sky.\n\nSpecies: Griffin (Gryps montanus)\n\nWould you rather raise a griffin chick yourself, or leave the babysitting to Peter Griffin?\n\n#griffin #mythicalcreatures #naturedocumentary"
